states what that means in practice.

CONTENT — the documentation under docs/, the measured artefacts under out/ and
web/src/data/generated/ and web/public/data/, the figures the site renders, and
the prose of this repository: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
(CC BY 4.0), https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode.

INGESTED DATA is not covered by either, and this repository does not relicense
it. HPO, Orphanet, ClinVar, gnomAD, STRING, Reactome, the Human Protein Atlas,
DepMap, the GWAS Catalog, CELLxGENE, the FDA device list and the Stanford HIVDB
each carry their own terms; docs/references/README.md records them per source.
Redistributing a derivative of one of those obliges you to that source's licence
as well as to this one.

