================================================================================
NOT MEDICAL ADVICE
================================================================================

Nothing here is a diagnosis, a treatment recommendation, or clinical guidance.
The artefacts describe what public catalogues record and where their evidence
stops. Several of them exist specifically to show that a published number is
weaker than it appears. Do not act on them clinically.

